WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.952 --> 01:37.936
=Episode 25=

02:03.190 --> 02:03.990
His Majesty,

02:04.069 --> 02:05.429
the Grand Empress Dowager,

02:05.429 --> 02:06.670
and the Empress have arrived!

02:16.640 --> 02:18.460
(Jiuxiao Banquet Hall)

02:20.950 --> 02:22.469
Greetings to Your Majesties:
the Emperor,

02:22.469 --> 02:23.869
the Grand Empress Dowager,

02:23.869 --> 02:24.670
and the Empress.

02:24.990 --> 02:25.510
Be seated.

02:26.070 --> 02:27.270
Thank you, Your Majesty.

02:34.110 --> 02:36.790
I specially brought dancers
from Shaqiong

02:36.830 --> 02:38.790
to perform the Splendid Huayan Dance

02:38.790 --> 02:40.309
in celebration
of your birthday, Grand Empress Dowager.

03:17.510 --> 03:18.469
Wonderful.

03:24.189 --> 03:25.270
This pose

03:25.270 --> 03:27.869
of playing the pipa behind the back

03:27.869 --> 03:29.629
is rather unusual.

03:30.149 --> 03:31.589
What does it signify?

03:31.950 --> 03:33.230
Grand Empress Dowager,

03:34.469 --> 03:37.110
Miss Xie is recorded
in the Ganlin gazetteer three times

03:37.189 --> 03:39.110
and knows the customs
of the Gandu Circuit

03:39.110 --> 03:40.189
very well.

03:40.189 --> 03:42.110
May she come forward and answer?

03:42.469 --> 03:43.350
Granted.

04:00.270 --> 04:02.990
This is the pipa-behind-the-back pose

04:02.990 --> 04:04.390
from Shaqiong's celestial dance.

04:05.950 --> 04:08.230
The dancer twists and turns her body,

04:08.309 --> 04:09.149
with her left arm

04:09.149 --> 04:10.749
cradling the pipa behind her,

04:11.270 --> 04:12.790
while her right hand
plucks the strings backward,

04:12.909 --> 04:14.070
as though embracing the moon.

04:14.830 --> 04:16.230
Her fingers open and close

04:16.230 --> 04:17.710
like a blooming lotus,

04:17.949 --> 04:18.990
symbolizing the lotus

04:18.990 --> 04:20.990
that rises unstained from the mud.

04:25.550 --> 04:27.269
More than the dance,

04:28.230 --> 04:29.710
I'm more interested

04:29.710 --> 04:31.030
in you.

04:31.470 --> 04:33.030
How old are you?

04:35.429 --> 04:36.629
Grand Empress Dowager,

04:36.629 --> 04:37.829
I am

04:38.910 --> 04:39.990
twenty-four this year.

04:40.509 --> 04:43.429
Then why do you still wear
an unmarried woman's hairstyle?

04:49.350 --> 04:50.629
Grand Empress Dowager,

04:51.309 --> 04:52.069
I am

04:52.189 --> 04:53.710
Miss Xie's fiance.

04:54.590 --> 04:55.910
Back in Ganlin,

04:56.069 --> 04:57.389
we were already betrothed,

04:57.710 --> 04:58.990
but the war delayed us,

04:59.470 --> 05:01.150
and we have yet to marry.

05:01.710 --> 05:02.670
So...

05:06.749 --> 05:08.869
Miss Xie is truly an exceptional woman.

05:09.309 --> 05:10.590
Though born to a distinguished family,

05:10.590 --> 05:12.429
she willingly followed her fiance

05:12.429 --> 05:13.550
all the way to the frontier.

05:13.869 --> 05:15.110
Such courage

05:15.110 --> 05:16.710
is rare indeed.

05:19.309 --> 05:21.269
Which distinguished family are you from?

05:24.350 --> 05:25.670
Grand Empress Dowager,

05:26.829 --> 05:28.110
I was born

05:29.829 --> 05:30.990
into the Fu family of Huaying.

05:36.150 --> 05:37.629
Is it

05:37.629 --> 05:39.710
the Fu family of Huaying

05:39.710 --> 05:40.829
with three chastity memorial arches?

05:42.910 --> 05:44.869
I've heard of them.

05:45.150 --> 05:46.590
Their women are known for chastity,

05:46.869 --> 05:48.309
and their men for filial devotion.

05:49.749 --> 05:51.069
Then why

05:51.069 --> 05:52.150
did you change your surname to Xie?

05:59.949 --> 06:01.470
Grand Empress Dowager,

06:02.030 --> 06:03.350
when chaos broke out in Huaying,

06:03.590 --> 06:04.869
Fifth Madam Fu

06:04.869 --> 06:05.829
feared for her daughter's safety

06:06.069 --> 06:06.990
and entrusted her to me

06:06.990 --> 06:07.829
to take her away.

06:08.910 --> 06:09.869
To keep her safe,

06:10.309 --> 06:11.509
she had no choice
but to change her surname.

06:12.470 --> 06:15.309
If the name was changed only
to keep her safe,

06:15.710 --> 06:16.590
now

06:16.590 --> 06:18.350
she may return to her true family name.

06:19.069 --> 06:19.790
Grandmother,

06:20.189 --> 06:22.030
their marriage had their
elders' approval,

06:22.309 --> 06:23.629
and hardship proved their devotion.

06:24.110 --> 06:25.670
They are a rare and devoted pair.

06:26.710 --> 06:27.230
I

06:27.629 --> 06:29.110
intend to decree their marriage.

06:29.790 --> 06:30.550
I ask

06:30.749 --> 06:32.189
for your verbal approval as well.

06:33.110 --> 06:34.550
This jade ruyi today

06:34.790 --> 06:36.550
will make the perfect wedding gift.

06:41.710 --> 06:43.670
Congratulations, Commander Zhao
and Miss Fu.

06:43.990 --> 06:45.590
Now that you've received
a marriage decree,

06:45.590 --> 06:46.509
when you return home,

06:46.509 --> 06:48.110
be sure to tell your elders

06:48.389 --> 06:49.590
the good news.

06:51.309 --> 06:51.990
By the way,

06:52.309 --> 06:55.030
there's been quite a stir
in the capital lately.

06:55.509 --> 06:57.389
They say you defied your father

06:57.389 --> 06:58.710
and took it upon yourself

06:59.150 --> 07:00.470
to move your grandmother's grave.

07:00.829 --> 07:01.910
Is that true?

07:04.429 --> 07:05.069
Yes.

07:06.710 --> 07:07.990
Grandmother's final wish

07:08.389 --> 07:10.509
was to be buried
in our ancestral cemetery in Huaying.

07:11.869 --> 07:13.269
You did the right thing.

07:13.710 --> 07:15.230
As descendants,

07:15.389 --> 07:17.030
we cannot honor only our parents

07:17.269 --> 07:19.269
and neglect our grandmother.

07:23.504 --> 07:25.610
(Yu Residence)

07:28.590 --> 07:29.710
In this entire world,

07:30.350 --> 07:31.590
I've only ever found one person

07:31.590 --> 07:32.590
who was truly different.

07:33.629 --> 07:34.829
And yet she...

07:37.590 --> 07:39.590
will never be mine.

07:40.749 --> 07:41.470
Young Master,

07:42.629 --> 07:43.590
Ninth Young Lady

07:43.790 --> 07:45.030
is about to be married.

07:45.790 --> 07:46.990
Please let her go.

07:49.990 --> 07:51.230
I truly envy her.

07:52.110 --> 07:53.949
She can marry the man she chooses,

07:54.509 --> 07:56.590
defy convention and stand up
to her own father,

07:59.110 --> 08:00.829
and forge a future for herself.

08:02.990 --> 08:03.949
How could I

08:06.429 --> 08:08.030
ever let go of a woman like that?

08:09.590 --> 08:10.749
The Grand Empress Dowager

08:10.749 --> 08:12.590
praised Zhao Ling and Fu Tingyun

08:12.590 --> 08:13.350
for their filial devotion.

08:13.949 --> 08:15.110
And what did His Majesty say?

08:15.429 --> 08:16.429
His Majesty said

08:16.990 --> 08:18.990
the Grand Empress Dowager
was absolutely right.

08:19.590 --> 08:21.749
He even said the two were
more filial than Fifth Master Fu.

08:25.350 --> 08:26.710
That doesn't sound

08:27.309 --> 08:29.269
like a compliment.

08:52.789 --> 08:53.710
(A little to the left.)

08:53.710 --> 08:54.149
(Over here.)

08:54.149 --> 08:54.950
Let me see.

08:54.950 --> 08:56.470
That should be about everything.

08:56.470 --> 08:56.990
Hang them outside.

08:56.990 --> 08:57.629
All right.

08:57.629 --> 08:58.310
Take your time.

08:58.470 --> 08:59.549
You two, come here.

09:00.110 --> 09:00.509
(Coming.)

09:00.509 --> 09:00.909
(Here.)

09:01.029 --> 09:01.590
(This one.)

09:01.830 --> 09:02.509
(Easy.)

09:02.509 --> 09:02.830
(Okay.)

09:02.830 --> 09:03.710
(Put it up over there.)

09:06.110 --> 09:06.669
Biao.

09:09.590 --> 09:10.190
Sen,

09:10.789 --> 09:11.789
aren't you going to help?

09:12.549 --> 09:13.789
I'm not the one getting married.

09:16.629 --> 09:17.310
Sen,

09:18.230 --> 09:19.789
Mr. Zhao lost his parents
at a young age.

09:19.869 --> 09:20.789
According to custom,

09:20.869 --> 09:22.269
you, as his younger brother,

09:22.269 --> 09:23.509
must stand in for his father
and elder brother.

09:23.509 --> 09:25.190
Before the wedding, he must perform
the pre-wedding admonition rite.

09:25.710 --> 09:26.669
The pre-wedding admonition rite?

09:27.269 --> 09:28.430
Mr. Zhao has to bow to you three times,

09:28.430 --> 09:29.470
and you should advise him
as a father should.

09:29.470 --> 09:30.909
What? How can that be proper?

09:31.269 --> 09:32.470
Mr. Zhao bowing to me?

09:32.470 --> 09:33.430
That would be improper.

09:33.430 --> 09:34.909
The Thunder God would strike me dead!

09:35.509 --> 09:36.470
Then tell us,

09:36.830 --> 09:38.269
what exactly is your relationship
with Mr. Zhao?

09:38.470 --> 09:38.909
I...

09:39.869 --> 09:40.310
I...

09:40.789 --> 09:41.669
We're brothers.

09:46.950 --> 09:47.830
Miss Fu

09:47.950 --> 09:49.669
was raised in a family steeped
in learning and tradition.

09:49.830 --> 09:51.190
She cares deeply
about these old customs.

09:51.950 --> 09:53.350
If you really don't want to do it,

09:54.190 --> 09:55.549
go tell Mr. Zhao yourself.

10:00.160 --> 10:02.748
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

10:02.749 --> 10:04.269
You are so good.

10:05.830 --> 10:06.549
This is

10:06.629 --> 10:08.110
a wedding gift I made myself.

10:08.549 --> 10:09.629
May your marriage

10:09.869 --> 10:10.830
be happy and blessed.

10:20.789 --> 10:22.509
When you marry Miss Fu,

10:22.950 --> 10:24.269
do I really have to be there

10:24.710 --> 10:26.110
for the ceremony to be complete?

10:31.869 --> 10:32.869
If you don't come,

10:35.669 --> 10:36.509
the wedding can still go ahead.

10:38.830 --> 10:39.990
It would just be a shame.

10:42.470 --> 10:43.669
I mean, Miss Fu

10:45.350 --> 10:46.389
would be hurt.

10:46.990 --> 10:47.470
Well...

10:49.509 --> 10:50.590
That wouldn't be good.

10:51.230 --> 10:51.669
I...

10:52.350 --> 10:53.710
Anyway, I can't attend.

10:54.789 --> 10:56.629
Sen, you're not a child anymore.

10:56.950 --> 10:57.990
If you don't want to be close to me,

10:57.990 --> 10:58.909
I won't hold it against you.

10:58.909 --> 10:59.269
I...

10:59.470 --> 11:00.950
But she's looked after you
for all these years.

11:01.830 --> 11:02.710
If you don't come,

11:03.509 --> 11:04.990
wouldn't you be letting her down?

11:07.190 --> 11:08.350
An elder brother's wife
is like a mother...

11:08.350 --> 11:10.029
That's exactly my point!

11:10.389 --> 11:11.789
How can I let you two bow to me?

11:11.789 --> 11:12.110
I...

11:14.070 --> 11:15.310
Did that work?

11:16.070 --> 11:16.789
I don't care anymore.

11:18.190 --> 11:18.590
You...

11:19.990 --> 11:20.629
What are you doing?

11:20.629 --> 11:21.549
Let me finish bowing to you first.

11:22.070 --> 11:23.110
Then we'll be even.

11:23.110 --> 11:24.749
After I bow to you,
I'll go bow to Miss Fu too.

11:25.070 --> 11:25.869
As for the admonition rite, I...

11:26.350 --> 11:27.470
I'll reluctantly

11:27.470 --> 11:28.269
stand in for your elders.

11:32.070 --> 11:32.909
Get up.

11:36.990 --> 11:39.070
The admonition rite is when the groom
kneels to his parents.

11:39.669 --> 11:40.549
Kneel to the parents?

11:40.549 --> 11:42.190
I'm the one getting married,
so I'm the one who kneels.

11:42.990 --> 11:44.269
It's not your place to kneel.

11:45.710 --> 11:46.350
Chuan!

11:47.070 --> 11:48.149
This was your idea, wasn't it?

11:49.269 --> 11:50.590
Biao alone

11:52.110 --> 11:53.190
could never have fooled you.

11:56.509 --> 11:57.190
Mr. Zhao.

11:59.590 --> 12:00.389
There's

12:01.070 --> 12:02.029
one more thing.

12:03.190 --> 12:04.310
About Yucheng's death...

12:05.470 --> 12:06.470
I don't blame you.

12:08.590 --> 12:10.029
I let it go a long time ago.

12:12.310 --> 12:13.549
You're about to get married.

12:14.590 --> 12:15.749
Don't let me spoil the occasion.

12:46.869 --> 12:47.389
All right.

12:47.590 --> 12:48.470
I'm going to beat those two up now.

12:49.230 --> 12:49.950
Wait.

13:01.789 --> 13:02.990
Hit them hard.

13:10.110 --> 13:10.749
Chuan.

13:11.110 --> 13:12.029
I need to talk to you.

13:12.990 --> 13:13.749
Sen's here!

13:13.830 --> 13:14.710
Sen's here!

13:14.710 --> 13:15.350
It wasn't me!

13:15.909 --> 13:16.509
Get him first!

13:16.789 --> 13:17.190
Sen.

13:17.190 --> 13:17.710
You two dared

13:17.710 --> 13:18.389
to trick me?

13:18.869 --> 13:19.590
You think I'm an idiot?

13:20.629 --> 13:21.190
Don't run!

13:35.640 --> 13:39.120
(Double Happiness)

13:39.120 --> 13:41.260
(Double Happiness)

13:41.260 --> 13:44.200
(Double Happiness)

13:44.200 --> 13:48.400
(Fragrant Lamps and Bright Candles;
Double Happiness)

13:57.190 --> 13:58.269
It's such a happy day.

13:58.269 --> 13:59.430
Why are you crying?

13:59.990 --> 14:02.230
After watching Miss Fu and Mr. Zhao
come this far,

14:03.789 --> 14:05.310
through all those hardships,

14:07.070 --> 14:08.509
they've finally made it
to their happy ending.

14:08.509 --> 14:09.149
I just...

14:11.110 --> 14:12.230
All right.

14:12.549 --> 14:13.869
You're too old to be crying like this.

14:17.600 --> 14:21.960
(Double Happiness)

14:23.389 --> 14:24.590
With the grave relocation coming up,

14:25.149 --> 14:26.830
Father knows there's no hope
of returning to office,

14:27.149 --> 14:28.909
so he spends every day drowning
his sorrows.

14:31.710 --> 14:32.789
Your brother and I

14:32.869 --> 14:34.749
are planning to take the children back
to Huaying.

14:35.789 --> 14:38.110
We've dismissed all the maids
and servants we no longer need.

14:38.869 --> 14:39.509
So now,

14:39.749 --> 14:40.389
all these

14:40.389 --> 14:42.070
plants and household chores

14:42.470 --> 14:43.629
have been left unattended.

14:44.190 --> 14:45.230
Sorry you had to see the place
like this.

15:14.230 --> 15:15.310
In two days,

15:16.310 --> 15:17.669
Zhao Ling and I are getting married.

15:19.070 --> 15:21.990
You actually came to invite me?

15:23.310 --> 15:24.549
You've got some nerve.

15:24.990 --> 15:27.230
The invitations are for my mother,
brother, and sister-in-law,

15:31.869 --> 15:32.909
because I know

15:34.950 --> 15:36.029
you won't come.

15:53.470 --> 15:54.950
You two...

15:57.430 --> 15:59.310
One, a woman who eloped,

16:00.029 --> 16:02.230
the other, a rogue and a bandit.

16:02.909 --> 16:04.830
You married without our consent,

16:05.070 --> 16:06.990
and still had the nerve
to send me an invitation?

16:08.350 --> 16:09.509
As for your marriage,

16:10.669 --> 16:12.549
heaven and earth may allow it,

16:12.830 --> 16:14.669
but your father does not.

16:15.789 --> 16:17.749
So this marriage does not count.

16:29.629 --> 16:30.789
You are my father,

16:31.830 --> 16:33.230
and I owe you for giving me life.

16:33.350 --> 16:34.749
I came today

16:36.310 --> 16:38.590
because I still held on
to a foolish hope.

16:46.269 --> 16:47.990
My marriage to Zhao Ling

16:48.430 --> 16:50.110
has the Grand Empress Dowager

16:50.190 --> 16:51.350
giving us her blessing,

16:52.149 --> 16:54.389
and His Majesty personally
granting the marriage.

16:55.070 --> 16:56.830
So how, Fifth Master,

16:56.909 --> 16:58.629
does this become a marriage
against our elders' wishes?

17:10.589 --> 17:12.230
Bring Mother to attend the ceremony.

17:13.950 --> 17:15.190
In other people's eyes,

17:16.230 --> 17:17.990
you'll at least still have the title

17:17.990 --> 17:19.549
of Zhao Ling's father-in-law.

17:20.269 --> 17:21.749
Even if you can never return
to the office,

17:22.349 --> 17:23.509
in the years ahead,

17:24.230 --> 17:25.390
life will still be easier for you.

17:25.640 --> 17:26.260
(Invitation)

17:30.710 --> 17:33.870
Zhao Ling's father-in-law...

17:40.950 --> 17:42.029
Let me tell you something.

17:42.789 --> 17:44.670
You didn't come here today
to deliver an invitation.

17:44.670 --> 17:46.230
You came to mock me!

17:49.910 --> 17:50.549
Fine.

17:50.950 --> 17:52.390
Let me tell you, Fu Tingyun.

17:52.829 --> 17:53.950
You listen carefully.

17:54.749 --> 17:56.069
I'll make this clear today.

17:56.589 --> 17:58.910
Even if I never return to office
in this lifetime,

17:59.349 --> 18:01.109
you are in no position to mock me!

18:02.190 --> 18:04.670
Whatever happens, I am still
your mother's husband

18:04.829 --> 18:06.910
and the head of this household.

18:07.349 --> 18:09.710
You want your mother
to attend your wedding?

18:10.309 --> 18:11.430
In your dreams!

18:11.870 --> 18:13.710
You will not see your mother!

18:13.710 --> 18:14.430
And I said so!

18:14.430 --> 18:15.509
You won't see her!

18:23.749 --> 18:26.029
Zhao Ling's father-in-law?

18:37.430 --> 18:38.789
If he won't let me see Mother,

18:38.789 --> 18:40.269
why can't I just force my way in?

18:40.509 --> 18:41.390
Ninth Young Lady,

18:41.509 --> 18:43.029
Fifth Madam specifically asked

18:43.230 --> 18:45.470
that you not quarrel with Master
over this.

18:45.470 --> 18:47.470
You and your future husband
have come too far

18:47.470 --> 18:49.190
to risk more trouble now.

18:49.509 --> 18:51.309
If you openly fight
with your own father,

18:51.630 --> 18:52.990
Madam will be the one
who suffers for it.

18:59.309 --> 19:00.150
Mother...

19:00.990 --> 19:02.069
I

19:02.069 --> 19:04.349
pledge the fortune of this life
and the next

19:05.069 --> 19:06.630
in exchange for my daughter Tingyun's

19:06.870 --> 19:08.230
marital bliss

19:09.190 --> 19:10.710
and a life free of hardship.

19:14.190 --> 19:15.589
Madam and your uncle

19:15.589 --> 19:17.630
have each prepared a dowry gift for you.

19:18.549 --> 19:20.749
Though Madam can't personally
see you off as a bride,

19:21.670 --> 19:23.630
you'll still have all the honor
and ceremony

19:23.950 --> 19:25.029
a bride deserves.

19:26.630 --> 19:28.549
This bridal sash is from Madam.

20:00.870 --> 20:02.870
I've chosen a young woman for you.

20:03.349 --> 20:04.509
She's attractive

20:04.630 --> 20:05.829
and gentle by nature.

20:06.349 --> 20:07.269
Why not

20:07.870 --> 20:09.630
take her into your household
as a concubine?

20:15.789 --> 20:18.069
A man should take a concubine
only if he is still childless at forty.

20:20.630 --> 20:22.309
I shouldn't give anyone grounds
to criticize me.

20:25.549 --> 20:26.349
Jingxiu,

20:27.069 --> 20:28.309
between mother and son,

20:29.150 --> 20:31.029
there's no need for such formal excuses.

20:33.069 --> 20:33.910
Back then,

20:34.309 --> 20:36.190
I chose the Fu family's Ninth
Young Lady for you

20:36.990 --> 20:38.509
because I thought she was best for you.

20:40.029 --> 20:41.749
You insisted on marrying Fan.

20:42.390 --> 20:43.509
Though I disapproved,

20:44.549 --> 20:46.190
I still let you have your way.

20:48.549 --> 20:49.710
But all these years,

20:50.789 --> 20:52.190
do you really think

20:53.390 --> 20:54.990
I don't know what's missing
in your heart?

21:01.150 --> 21:02.950
You and Madam Fan treat
each other with respect,

21:04.549 --> 21:06.549
but there's always been a distance
between you.

21:07.950 --> 21:09.910
I'm not so old-fashioned.

21:11.190 --> 21:12.950
If I hadn't seen how unhappy you are,

21:13.230 --> 21:14.990
why would I bring another woman
into your household?

21:18.029 --> 21:19.190
I only hope

21:20.789 --> 21:22.789
you won't keep grieving over
that magnolia.

21:44.784 --> 21:47.616
(Xie Residence)

21:47.664 --> 21:50.020
(Double Happiness)

22:02.160 --> 22:03.715
(Spirit Tablet of My Late Father,
Zhao Wenyuan)

22:03.716 --> 22:05.160
(Spirit Tablet of My Late Mother,
Lady Li)

22:09.760 --> 22:14.970
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

22:16.720 --> 22:23.040
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

22:24.600 --> 22:30.992
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

22:32.760 --> 22:39.248
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

22:40.060 --> 22:43.360
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

22:43.728 --> 22:48.160
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

22:48.540 --> 22:54.256
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

23:18.029 --> 23:19.549
That scoundrel

23:19.910 --> 23:21.190
actually has the nerve to come.

23:21.749 --> 23:22.549
Grab your weapons.

23:23.829 --> 23:24.549
Shut the gates.

23:24.990 --> 23:26.109
If he dares force his way in,

23:26.109 --> 23:26.789
drive him out.

23:27.069 --> 23:27.749
Yes.

23:33.470 --> 23:34.069
Open the gate!

23:34.470 --> 23:35.230
Open the gate!

23:35.509 --> 23:36.109
Open the gate!

23:36.749 --> 23:37.749
Open the gate!

23:37.749 --> 23:38.390
Open the gate!

23:38.870 --> 23:40.230
Open the gate!

23:41.029 --> 23:41.549
Open the gate!

23:42.190 --> 23:42.589
Open the gate!

23:42.589 --> 23:43.430
Hold the gate!

23:43.430 --> 23:43.789
Open the gate!

23:43.789 --> 23:44.430
Hold the gate!

23:44.670 --> 23:46.230
If that bandit really breaks in,

23:46.230 --> 23:47.190
beat him back out!

23:47.190 --> 23:48.029
Beat him senseless!

23:48.630 --> 23:49.430
Open the gate!

23:51.190 --> 23:51.950
Hold the gate!

24:00.520 --> 24:00.800
(Fu Residence)

24:17.349 --> 24:17.950
Come on!

24:18.589 --> 24:19.870
Come on! I'll kill you!

24:21.870 --> 24:22.549
Zhao Ling!

24:23.029 --> 24:23.950
You bandit.

24:23.950 --> 24:25.029
You wastrel!

24:27.549 --> 24:29.309
You dare use force to defy the law!

24:30.069 --> 24:31.910
The Fu family has upheld learning
and propriety for generations.

24:31.910 --> 24:33.029
As a fourth-rank official,

24:33.870 --> 24:34.710
you...

24:34.710 --> 24:35.589
break the law you serve.

24:35.589 --> 24:36.789
If you dare take one more step,

24:37.309 --> 24:38.390
I'll shoot you!

24:38.509 --> 24:39.150
Come on!

25:11.390 --> 25:12.269
Please forgive me, Mother.

25:12.670 --> 25:13.589
I understand

25:13.589 --> 25:14.910
you didn't want us to cause
any more trouble.

25:16.470 --> 25:17.630
But after everything that's happened,

25:18.430 --> 25:20.069
even if the whole world condemns me,

25:20.990 --> 25:22.150
I won't let you and your daughter

25:23.109 --> 25:24.269
carry this regret for life.

25:24.589 --> 25:25.910
Knowing you cherish her this much,

25:26.470 --> 25:27.749
I can finally rest easy.

25:29.069 --> 25:30.789
When I gave you the jade bracelet,

25:31.190 --> 25:31.990
part of me

25:32.470 --> 25:34.470
trusted that you were a good
and honorable man.

25:34.470 --> 25:35.589
The rest was a gamble.

25:36.430 --> 25:37.589
Looking at you now...

25:38.470 --> 25:39.789
Heaven has been kind to me.

25:40.390 --> 25:41.710
My gamble paid off.

25:42.950 --> 25:44.069
In my own life,

25:45.950 --> 25:47.390
my marriage brought me little happiness.

25:48.670 --> 25:50.269
I was weak by nature

25:50.749 --> 25:51.910
and failed

25:52.990 --> 25:54.349
to set a good example for my children.

25:55.509 --> 25:57.109
My only wish is that the two of you

25:57.589 --> 25:58.950
will always be of one heart

26:00.109 --> 26:01.470
and weather every storm together.

26:08.430 --> 26:08.910
Please.

26:10.549 --> 26:11.230
Stop!

26:12.349 --> 26:12.950
Zhao Ling.

26:13.109 --> 26:14.069
For what you've done today,

26:14.069 --> 26:15.470
the censors will impeach you

26:15.470 --> 26:16.349
and you'll be cursed by all!

26:17.390 --> 26:18.870
She belongs to the Fu family.

26:18.870 --> 26:20.150
If you insist on taking her,

26:20.670 --> 26:22.190
I'll kill her right now!

26:29.630 --> 26:30.950
Scumbag.

26:53.589 --> 26:55.190
Since you have no love or decency left,

26:55.190 --> 26:56.829
don't blame me for showing you none
in return.

26:59.910 --> 27:00.950
Biao. Chuan.

27:01.589 --> 27:02.990
Escort my mother-in-law home!

27:04.349 --> 27:04.829
This way, please.

27:06.029 --> 27:06.630
You...

27:06.630 --> 27:07.269
How dare you!

27:10.589 --> 27:12.029
If you walk out that gate today,

27:12.029 --> 27:13.349
don't ever come back!

27:14.470 --> 27:17.509
I've drunk horse blood and slept
among corpses.

27:19.069 --> 27:21.230
I've survived countless battles.

27:21.829 --> 27:24.109
Why would I fear the whole world
cursing my name?

27:40.190 --> 27:41.069
Careful, Mother.

27:43.549 --> 27:44.430
Tingzhuo,

27:44.670 --> 27:45.549
my sister is getting married.

27:46.150 --> 27:46.990
As her elder brother,

27:47.230 --> 27:48.269
how could I not see her

27:48.470 --> 27:49.390
into her bridal sedan?

27:53.589 --> 27:54.710
Thank you, Tingzhuo, Shen.

27:58.430 --> 27:58.990
Please.

28:02.600 --> 28:04.400
(Fu Residence)

28:04.400 --> 28:07.349
(Double Happiness)

28:07.349 --> 28:08.430
The groom is here!

28:10.760 --> 28:12.109
(Xie Jewelry Shop)

28:12.109 --> 28:13.749
The auspicious hour cannot be missed.

28:13.749 --> 28:14.670
Make way!

28:14.829 --> 28:15.829
Make way!

28:15.829 --> 28:16.670
Coming through!

28:18.829 --> 28:20.269
Our wedding

28:21.910 --> 28:22.789
will be grand.

28:23.269 --> 28:24.549
You'll have an eight-bearer
bridal sedan,

28:25.470 --> 28:26.630
with music and fanfare all the way!

28:26.870 --> 28:27.789
Mr. Zhao

28:27.910 --> 28:29.430
always keeps his word!

28:30.390 --> 28:32.430
Wonderful!

28:32.430 --> 28:32.789
What...

28:32.870 --> 28:34.309
What's gotten into Mr. Zhao?

28:37.069 --> 28:38.029
Those are all things

28:39.390 --> 28:40.829
he promised me before.

28:52.549 --> 28:53.749
(Double Happiness)
Today, I, Tingyun,

28:53.990 --> 28:55.069
bid farewell to my maternal family.

28:56.589 --> 28:58.069
First, I thank you, Mother,
for raising me.

28:58.069 --> 28:59.430
Second, I thank you, Uncle,
for all your help.

29:00.390 --> 29:02.230
There's no need to thank me.

29:03.349 --> 29:05.269
You're my own niece.

29:05.509 --> 29:06.309
Tingyun,

29:06.749 --> 29:07.589
remember this.

29:08.029 --> 29:08.910
The Xie family

29:09.349 --> 29:11.069
will always be your home.

29:11.670 --> 29:12.950
After you marry Zhao Ling,

29:13.109 --> 29:14.589
being a good wife and raising children

29:14.589 --> 29:15.990
comes second.

29:17.269 --> 29:18.549
What matters most

29:19.670 --> 29:21.789
is that you take good care of yourself.

29:25.910 --> 29:26.470
Alright.

29:43.029 --> 29:43.829
Tingzhuo.

29:44.190 --> 29:44.870
Tingyun.

29:46.390 --> 29:47.150
You came.

29:49.630 --> 29:50.509
Where's Mother?

29:50.749 --> 29:51.470
Don't worry.

29:51.829 --> 29:53.269
Zhao Ling has taken care of everything.

30:06.840 --> 30:10.920
(Double Happiness)

30:10.921 --> 30:15.000
(Double Happiness)

30:18.069 --> 30:19.150
Congratulations.

30:19.470 --> 30:20.230
Would you like

30:23.789 --> 30:25.309
to ride in a bridal sedan for once?

30:29.789 --> 30:30.910
Whether I wanted to or not,

30:32.230 --> 30:33.630
I've already ridden in one twice.

30:41.829 --> 30:43.710
Wonderful!

30:44.390 --> 30:45.990
Wonderful!

30:45.990 --> 30:47.069
Congratulations!

30:47.390 --> 30:48.630
Congratulations!

30:50.829 --> 30:52.349
(Xie Jewelry Shop)
May you soon be blessed with a son!

30:53.789 --> 30:54.230
Good!

30:55.349 --> 30:57.309
Wonderful!

30:58.048 --> 30:59.770
(Bilan Teahouse)

31:00.269 --> 31:01.470
Looks like there's a wedding.

31:02.549 --> 31:03.309
Come on, let's go!

31:03.549 --> 31:04.190
Let me see.

31:04.430 --> 31:05.269
What a celebration!

31:05.269 --> 31:06.549
It's Commander Zhao's wedding.

31:12.109 --> 31:12.950
Miss Wu, look!

31:12.950 --> 31:14.509
That's Miss Xie's bridal sedan.

31:15.829 --> 31:16.910
What a grand procession.

31:24.589 --> 31:26.269
(Double Happiness)
The bride and groom have arrived!

31:56.829 --> 31:57.670
Mother.

31:58.150 --> 31:59.309
Your husband loves you dearly.

32:00.910 --> 32:02.509
He didn't want you to have any regrets,

32:03.190 --> 32:04.710
so he brought me here especially.

32:06.349 --> 32:07.630
Mother, you trusted me

32:08.630 --> 32:10.230
and entrusted Tingyun to my care.

32:11.630 --> 32:13.150
Tingyun has stood by me
with her wisdom and counsel.

32:13.630 --> 32:15.029
I owe everything I've achieved today
to her.

32:18.749 --> 32:19.549
I, Zhao Ling,

32:22.549 --> 32:23.589
have always been alone,

32:25.069 --> 32:26.150
with neither father nor mother.

32:28.150 --> 32:28.829
Today,

32:30.950 --> 32:32.470
I wish to honor you as my own mother.

32:33.670 --> 32:34.670
True filial devotion

32:35.109 --> 32:36.430
can bind hearts more deeply than blood,

32:37.349 --> 32:38.710
and chosen family can be dearer
than kin.

32:40.950 --> 32:41.630
Today,

32:42.109 --> 32:43.190
I humbly ask you, Mother,

32:45.549 --> 32:46.670
to preside over our wedding.

32:48.589 --> 32:50.710
To honor chosen family
above blood itself...

32:50.789 --> 32:51.470
that is

32:51.470 --> 32:52.549
the mark of a true gentleman.

32:53.109 --> 32:53.910
Commander Zhao

32:53.910 --> 32:55.269
is truly a most devoted son.

32:56.630 --> 32:58.029
The auspicious hour has come!

32:58.029 --> 32:59.789
Let the wedding ceremony begin!

33:10.560 --> 33:12.840
(Double Happiness)

33:20.509 --> 33:22.390
I commissioned a craftsman in Suzhou

33:22.749 --> 33:23.749
to make this riding tack for you.

33:24.309 --> 33:25.430
May you always

33:25.710 --> 33:26.829
ride a fine steed

33:27.430 --> 33:28.549
and rise to great heights.

33:32.829 --> 33:33.670
Thank you, Mother.

33:37.269 --> 33:38.069
Tingyun,

33:38.430 --> 33:40.390
besides your lavish dowry,

33:41.069 --> 33:42.749
there's one more special gift

33:42.749 --> 33:43.990
I want to give you.

33:47.990 --> 33:49.230
In this life,

33:49.390 --> 33:50.950
a surname is like the clothes we wear,

33:51.829 --> 33:53.109
only something others see.

33:54.549 --> 33:55.589
Whether Fu

33:55.589 --> 33:56.670
or Xie,

33:57.190 --> 33:58.109
it only tells

33:58.109 --> 33:59.150
where you came from.

33:59.470 --> 34:01.069
But your own name

34:01.470 --> 34:03.109
can speak to the path you choose

34:03.269 --> 34:03.910
and

34:03.910 --> 34:05.789
the person you wish to become.

34:06.109 --> 34:07.430
On this happy day,

34:07.749 --> 34:08.470
I

34:08.589 --> 34:10.029
would like to give you a courtesy name:

34:10.509 --> 34:11.430
Quanhui.

34:11.669 --> 34:12.549
Would you like that?

34:16.509 --> 34:18.589
May it mean a life blessed
with both fortune and wisdom.

34:24.470 --> 34:25.750
When you were born,

34:25.830 --> 34:27.669
your grandmother named you

34:27.669 --> 34:28.470
Tingyun.

34:29.589 --> 34:31.390
It meant that within the family home,

34:32.109 --> 34:33.709
all things would flourish.

34:35.830 --> 34:38.229
But I never liked that name.

34:38.709 --> 34:40.990
I never wanted your bright future

34:40.990 --> 34:43.149
to be tied to the fate of one family.

34:43.669 --> 34:45.709
I never wanted you to carry
such a heavy burden.

34:46.470 --> 34:47.470
All I wish

34:48.310 --> 34:49.629
is for you to live
as your heart desires,

34:50.390 --> 34:52.029
blessed with both fortune and wisdom.

34:59.509 --> 35:00.709
Thank you, Mother.

35:05.709 --> 35:06.790
The ceremony is complete!

35:07.069 --> 35:08.669
To the bridal chamber!

35:08.669 --> 35:13.790
Wonderful!

35:22.109 --> 35:23.910
It's been ages since we've seen
a celebration like this.

35:23.910 --> 35:24.910
Exactly.

35:29.109 --> 35:31.029
Miss Xie looks so magnificent today.

35:31.669 --> 35:33.669
She's like a fairy straight
out of a painting.

35:33.669 --> 35:34.430
Yes.

35:35.270 --> 35:36.189
Listen to you.

35:36.270 --> 35:37.589
You're still calling her Miss Xie?

35:37.750 --> 35:38.709
You should be calling her

35:38.709 --> 35:39.990
Madam Zhao now.

35:40.229 --> 35:41.390
Exactly.

35:42.950 --> 35:43.950
(Double Happiness)
For the past five years,

35:44.990 --> 35:47.310
thanks to your guidance, Madam Wang,

35:48.629 --> 35:49.430
Tingyun

35:49.790 --> 35:50.910
would always write

35:50.910 --> 35:52.470
home about you.

35:53.029 --> 35:54.149
Between every line,

35:54.390 --> 35:55.870
I could see your influence on her.

35:56.189 --> 35:57.069
Riding,

35:57.069 --> 35:57.830
studying,

35:57.830 --> 35:58.709
teaching...

35:59.029 --> 36:00.229
everything she learned

36:00.509 --> 36:02.470
was thanks to your careful guidance.

36:05.310 --> 36:06.149
It's just that...

36:07.029 --> 36:08.589
as her mother, I...

36:09.629 --> 36:10.430
Fifth Madam,

36:10.870 --> 36:12.029
please don't say that.

36:12.470 --> 36:14.470
Without you, her own mother,

36:14.470 --> 36:15.950
who gave her life

36:16.189 --> 36:17.549
and such strength of character,

36:17.669 --> 36:19.470
how could she have become
the woman she is today?

36:21.390 --> 36:22.629
The way I see it,

36:22.629 --> 36:24.669
Madam Zhao is who she is today

36:24.750 --> 36:26.669
because of both of you.

36:27.350 --> 36:29.069
One gave her life,

36:29.350 --> 36:31.029
and the other gave her a future.

36:31.470 --> 36:33.310
She couldn't have done
without either of you.

36:33.310 --> 36:34.149
Isn't that right?

36:34.149 --> 36:35.109
Absolutely.

36:36.029 --> 36:36.950
Come, everyone.

36:36.950 --> 36:38.669
Let's raise our cups

36:38.830 --> 36:39.790
and give thanks

36:39.790 --> 36:41.910
to heaven for blessing them
with this happy union.

36:42.149 --> 36:43.589
Congratulations!

36:43.589 --> 36:44.350
Lord Wei, please.

36:45.149 --> 36:46.390
Everyone, drink up.

36:51.270 --> 36:51.830
Zheng San.

36:56.350 --> 36:56.950
Everyone,

36:57.790 --> 36:58.589
today

36:59.350 --> 37:00.270
is my wedding day.

37:00.910 --> 37:02.830
Thank you all for honoring us
with your presence.

37:03.229 --> 37:04.790
If anything has been lacking
in our hospitality,

37:06.029 --> 37:06.990
I ask for your understanding.

37:07.509 --> 37:09.069
Congratulations, Mr. Zhao!

37:09.189 --> 37:11.950
Congratulations, Commander Zhao!

37:12.149 --> 37:12.750
Cheers!

37:16.149 --> 37:16.709
Cheers!

37:16.709 --> 37:17.149
Everyone,

37:17.870 --> 37:18.669
thank you for coming.

37:20.950 --> 37:22.229
I'm drinking.

37:26.189 --> 37:26.950
Here.

37:28.270 --> 37:28.950
Give it to me.

37:28.950 --> 37:29.549
Come on.

37:36.189 --> 37:36.870
Tingzhuo.

37:37.149 --> 37:38.189
Fill it up. All the way.

37:38.750 --> 37:39.589
I drink to you.

37:40.229 --> 37:41.750
After all these years
and all we've been through,

37:42.669 --> 37:44.069
we finally ended up as family.

37:45.470 --> 37:46.629
Thank you, both you and Tingyun,

37:46.950 --> 37:48.509
for forgiving a coward like me.

37:49.069 --> 37:49.549
Cheers.

37:50.790 --> 37:51.270
Cheers.

37:58.990 --> 38:00.069
I've made up my mind.

38:00.990 --> 38:02.229
Your sister-in-law and I

38:02.470 --> 38:03.589
are going back to Huaying.

38:03.589 --> 38:04.830
Maybe I'll farm,

38:04.830 --> 38:06.029
or open a small private school

38:06.069 --> 38:07.509
and teach.

38:07.870 --> 38:09.270
Either way, I don't intend to return
to the capital.

38:11.790 --> 38:12.750
Don't try to talk me out of it.

38:13.149 --> 38:14.109
I've made up my mind.

38:16.270 --> 38:17.069
This toast

38:17.830 --> 38:18.549
is to you.

38:19.910 --> 38:21.189
She's my only sister.

38:21.350 --> 38:22.109
From now on,

38:23.029 --> 38:24.229
I'm entrusting her to you.

38:25.189 --> 38:25.990
If

38:27.029 --> 38:28.950
you ever make her suffer
in the slightest,

38:29.509 --> 38:30.750
I'll travel day and night

38:31.189 --> 38:32.149
all the way from Huaying

38:32.149 --> 38:33.149
back to the capital

38:33.509 --> 38:34.750
just to teach you a lesson.

38:35.870 --> 38:36.950
You remember that.

38:45.750 --> 38:46.589
I will

38:48.069 --> 38:50.229
remember your warning well, Tingzhuo.

38:54.470 --> 38:55.830
What a joyful celebration!

38:56.029 --> 38:57.029
Quite a crowd too!

38:58.029 --> 38:58.790
Zhao!

39:00.270 --> 39:00.870
Zhao!

39:00.870 --> 39:01.270
Mo!

39:01.270 --> 39:02.270
Congratulations!

39:02.509 --> 39:03.270
Thank you!

39:03.709 --> 39:04.390
Commander Wang!

39:05.270 --> 39:05.910
Commander Wang!

39:05.910 --> 39:06.509
Zhao,

39:06.509 --> 39:07.629
we've been racing

39:07.629 --> 39:08.790
all the way back for you.

39:08.790 --> 39:09.950
We finally made it back to the capital

39:09.950 --> 39:10.790
before you entered the bridal chamber.

39:10.790 --> 39:12.390
Good thing we didn't miss your big day.

39:12.390 --> 39:13.390
You haven't missed a thing.

39:13.390 --> 39:14.470
Then we'll have a few extra drinks.

39:14.470 --> 39:15.990
That won't keep you from your bride,
will it?

39:17.229 --> 39:17.870
General Mo.

39:17.870 --> 39:18.629
Your timing is perfect.

39:18.629 --> 39:19.189
Commander Wang,

39:19.189 --> 39:20.790
you finally made it in time
to celebrate the wedding.

39:20.790 --> 39:21.270
Good!

39:21.270 --> 39:21.870
Commander Wang,

39:21.950 --> 39:22.629
please, take a seat.

39:22.629 --> 39:23.189
Tonight,

39:23.189 --> 39:23.750
let's drink till we drop!

39:23.750 --> 39:24.509
Please, Commander Wang.

39:24.509 --> 39:25.549
Please.

39:25.549 --> 39:26.430
No one leaves sober tonight!

39:26.430 --> 39:27.310
Come on!

39:27.310 --> 39:27.830
Come on!

39:28.109 --> 39:28.870
Fill them up!

39:28.870 --> 39:30.310
Tonight,

39:30.310 --> 39:31.270
drink to your heart's content!

39:31.270 --> 39:31.709
All right!

39:31.709 --> 39:33.109
Then no one leaves sober!

39:33.109 --> 39:34.629
You got it! Come on!

39:34.629 --> 39:35.470
Cheers!

39:35.470 --> 39:36.390
Master Zhao

39:36.589 --> 39:38.830
is close to Commander Zhao and his wife.

39:39.029 --> 39:40.310
Why isn't he here today?

39:40.310 --> 39:41.549
He's a man of spiritual cultivation.

39:41.549 --> 39:42.870
It wouldn't be appropriate for him

39:42.870 --> 39:43.950
to attend a worldly banquet like this.

39:44.149 --> 39:44.589
Right.

39:44.589 --> 39:45.390
It wouldn't be appropriate.

39:45.509 --> 39:46.189
Yes.

39:46.470 --> 39:47.189
That makes sense.

39:49.990 --> 39:51.029
Even His Majesty

39:51.509 --> 39:52.910
didn't send anyone with a wedding gift.

39:53.029 --> 39:54.310
Eunuch Lian isn't here either.

39:54.310 --> 39:54.669
Well...

39:55.430 --> 39:56.830
I haven't heard anything about that.

39:57.310 --> 39:58.069
Lord Wei,

39:58.189 --> 39:58.870
a toast to you.

39:59.470 --> 40:00.029
Cheers.

40:00.109 --> 40:00.669
Cheers.

40:23.270 --> 40:24.629
Go back where you came from!

40:25.430 --> 40:26.669
My mother may have brought you
into this household,

40:27.029 --> 40:28.270
but that doesn't mean I'll accept you!

40:43.260 --> 40:45.376
(Next Episode)

40:45.669 --> 40:47.350
(I gave you more than enough time.)

40:47.350 --> 40:48.589
(I gave you more than enough chances.)

40:48.589 --> 40:49.350
(You were the one)

40:51.069 --> 40:52.149
(who failed to make me love you.)

40:52.149 --> 40:54.270
The most urgent matter right now

40:54.270 --> 40:55.430
is the drought!

40:55.430 --> 40:56.470
If your delays

40:56.470 --> 40:57.790
leave us short of funds,

40:57.990 --> 40:58.470
I

40:58.910 --> 40:59.990
will hold you personally responsible.

41:00.109 --> 41:01.589
Zhao Ling was reprimanded in public.

41:02.029 --> 41:03.310
(Xie Residence)
They're newly married,

41:03.629 --> 41:04.910
and already this has happened.

41:05.509 --> 41:06.430
I wonder

41:07.149 --> 41:08.669
if she'll regret her choice.

41:09.149 --> 41:11.310
As long as he loses the Emperor's favor,

41:11.709 --> 41:13.149
our plan

41:13.310 --> 41:14.790
will succeed.

41:26.960 --> 41:31.280
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

41:34.880 --> 41:39.240
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

41:41.360 --> 41:46.000
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

41:46.240 --> 41:49.040
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

41:50.200 --> 41:54.840
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

41:58.040 --> 42:04.880
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

42:05.760 --> 42:12.280
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

42:13.240 --> 42:16.680
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:17.200 --> 42:21.400
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:21.680 --> 42:27.360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

42:39.480 --> 42:43.360
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

42:47.280 --> 42:51.280
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

42:53.000 --> 42:57.680
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

42:58.000 --> 43:00.680
♪Kept close within my heart♪

43:01.760 --> 43:06.600
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

43:10.120 --> 43:17.040
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

43:17.920 --> 43:24.400
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

43:25.280 --> 43:28.800
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:29.240 --> 43:33.600
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:33.800 --> 43:39.520
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
